`Cap(IO.Console)` cannot be widened to `Cap(IO.FileWrite)` — `cap_narrow` only attenuates, so the source capability must subsume the target. [cap_widen]
help: `Cap(IO.FileWrite)` is not below `Cap(IO.Console)` in the capability lattice. Receive it from a caller that holds an ancestor of it.

